//! The UBL 2.1 element order, derived from the authorities' own instances.
//!
//! **Generated by `cargo xtask codegen`. Do not edit.**
//!
//! Parents and children observed in **325** published `Invoice` / `CreditNote`
//! documents of the reference corpus, covering 36 parent elements.
//! UBL 2.1 content models are XSD `sequence`s, and no Schematron rule
//! checks order.
//!
//! For each parent, the child order is the topological sort of the pairwise
//! precedences observed, taking the majority direction where instances
//! disagree. `cargo xtask codegen` fails on a cycle or a tied pair.
//!
//! The shared serialiser sorts every written element by this table.

